  "description": "HTTP integration for GM.Idempotency: an ASP.NET Core middleware that reads a client-supplied Idempotency-Key header, short-circuits duplicate unsafe (POST/PUT/PATCH) requests via GM.Idempotency's distributed-lock-guarded check-and-set, and replays the stored response (status, allow-listed headers, body) so a retry gets the exact same result. Opt in globally or per-endpoint with [Idempotent]. Register with AddGMIdempotencyHttp() + UseGMIdempotency().",
